ms screen.":[""],"Auto-tracked events":[""],"Visitor behaviour tracked without any code.":[""],"Scroll depth":[""],"Fire Scroll events at percentage thresholds":[""],"Thresholds (%)":[""],"Comma-separated percentages (1\u2013100).":[""],"Fire TimeOnPage events at second thresholds":[""],"Thresholds (seconds)":[""],"Comma-separated seconds.":[""],"Downloads":[""],"Fire Download events on file links":[""],"File extensions":[""],"Comma-separated file extensions to track.":[""],"Login":["Bejelentkez\u00e9s"],"Fire Login event when a user logs in":[""],"Sign-up":[""],"Fire CompleteRegistration event on user signup":[""],"Comment":["Hozz\u00e1sz\u00f3l\u00e1s"],"Fire Comment event on new comment submission":[""],"Phone clicks":[""],"Fire a Contact event when a visitor clicks a tel: link":[""],"Email clicks":[""],"Fire a Contact event when a visitor clicks a mailto: link":[""],"Thank-you pages":[""],"Fire a Lead event when the URL matches one of the fragments below":[""],"URL fragments":[""],"One URL fragment per line, e.g. koszonjuk. Matched case-insensitively against the page address, including any query string.":[""],"A successful submission fires a Lead event, also when the form is sent without reloading the page.":[""],"The Lead event is switched off on the Events screen, so form submissions are not tracked.":[""],"Open Events":[""],"Track %s submissions":[""],"None of the supported form plugins is installed on this site.":[""],"Supported: %s. A form plugin shows up here once it is active, and its tracking starts automatically.":[""],"WooCommerce is not active. Activate it to enable ecommerce events. Your settings here are kept until then.":[""],"Ecommerce events":[""],"View Product":[""],"Fire ViewContent on product pages":[""],"View Category":[""],"Fire ViewCategory on category archives":[""],"View Cart":["Kos\u00e1r"],"Fire ViewCart on the cart page":[""],"Add to Cart":["Kos\u00e1rba"],"Fire AddToCart when products are added":[""],"Initiate Checkout":[""],"Fire Ini